          "file": "tests/fixtures/luau-shield001/vulnerable/inventory-dynamic-key.server.luau",
          "line": 34,
          "note": "`itemName` (client-controlled) chooses which entry of `data.Inventory` is written"
        }
      ],
      "help_uri": "https://github.com/Topogamer0/luau-shield/blob/main/docs/rules/luau-shield001.md",
