      "file": "tests/fixtures/luau-shield001/vulnerable/plot-owners-are-not-admins.server.luau",
      "fix": "The Instance is never checked to belong to the player or to be where it should be. Verify ownership or location before using the Instance: `inst:IsDescendantOf(player.Character)`, compare an `Owner` attribute with `player.UserId`, check the distance to the character, or look it up in a server-side list of allowed instances.",
      "flow": [
        {
          "column": 76,
          "file": "tests/fixtures/luau-shield001/vulnerable/plot-owners-are-not-admins.server.luau",
